# Walkthrough: Futuristic 3D Humanoid Robot Portfolio

A highly interactive, state-of-the-art cyberpunk-themed portfolio website has been successfully built for **Akshai Santhosh**. The design is centered around a stylized 3D humanoid AI robot acting as a navigation system.

Below is an overview of the implementation, layout components, and visual confirmations.

---

