## Technical Implementations

### 1. Structure Updates (`index.html`)
- Added Canvas elements for the 3D WebGL renderer and 2D custom cursor trail.
- Implemented HUD metadata displays (bottom-left system status, bottom-right real-time screen coordinate displays, bottom-center interaction guidance).
- Built 8 absolute-positioned glassmorphic panels (`.holo-panel`) and corresponding floating indicators (`.holo-label-tag`).
- Imported Three.js, OrbitControls, and GSAP via high-speed CDNs.

### 2. Styling System (`style.css`)
- Styled a cyberpunk layout with a deep cybergrid background and neon primary accents (cyan `#00f0ff`, magenta `#ff007f`, purple `#9d00ff`).
- Structured a responsive glassmorphism layout using `backdrop-filter: blur(15px)` with glowing edges and bracket corner accents.
- Coded preloader boot sequence animations, custom scanlines, blinking green/cyan status indicators, and vertical/horizontal timelines.

### 3. Engine Logic (`script.js`)
- **WebGL Environment**: Set up Three.js with custom directional and point lighting (emissive/neon highlights) and exponential fog. Added a point headlight attached to the camera to illuminate metallic surfaces from the viewer's position.
- **Background Galaxy**: Generated a spiral vortex containing 1,300 glowing space particles swirling on the Y-axis.
- **Humanoid Robot Model**: Constructed the 3D robot using cylinder, sphere, and torus primitives. Structural metal parts are styled with high metalness silver-blue chrome (`0x889ab0`) and a subtle emissive glow (`0x161c28`) for clear visibility.
- **Coord Projections**: Projects 3D node coordinates onto the 2D HTML plane every frame, enabling leader-line label tags to track the robot as it moves/rotates.
- **Dynamic Synthesizer (Web Audio API)**: Programmatically synthesizes sounds on hover (pitch sweep), node clicks (sawtooth bass sweep + chime), and message dispatch success (C-major arpeggiated chord).
- **AI Voice Assistant**: Utilizes native `speechSynthesis` to narrate system boots and node entries.
- **Interaction Raycaster**: Tracks cursor positions in normalized device coordinates, triggering hover glows, holographic tooltip displays, and GSAP camera zooms on click.
- **Cognitive SVG Network**: Renders a glowing neural chart for the Skills tab with animated dash stroke offsets depicting data flows.

